<div>
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-orb"></div>
    <div class="hero-badge"><span class="pulse-dot"></span><span style="position:relative;z-index:1;">Buyers · Centralise & multiply</span></div>
    <h1>Solve it once. <span class="accent">Every entity inherits compliance.</span><span class="badge badge-accent" style="margin-left:10px;vertical-align:middle;">Net-new</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">A shared service centre or global capability centre runs payments for many group entities — so the 14 November 2026 deadline isn’t one project, it’s one per entity. ioNova ARS lets you centralise the fix: <b>a single tuned engine serves every entity</b>, each onboarded as one Channel Profile rather than new infrastructure, so the value of one integration multiplies across the whole group.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="https://dev.ionova.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Get a sandbox <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" /><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" /></svg></a>
      <a href="#implementation" class="btn btn-outline">See the implementation plan</a>
    </div>
    <div class="proof-bar">
      <div class="kpi-tile"><div class="kpi-value grad">1</div><div class="kpi-label">engine, every entity</div></div>
      <div class="kpi-tile"><div class="kpi-value grad-b">per-entity</div><div class="kpi-label">audit & reporting</div></div>
      <div class="kpi-tile"><div class="kpi-value grad-t">2–4 wks</div><div class="kpi-label">full group rollout</div></div>
      <div class="kpi-tile"><div class="kpi-value grad">VPC</div><div class="kpi-label">/ on-prem deploy</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section reveal">
    <div class="quote-card">
      <div class="quote-mark">&ldquo;</div>
      <div class="quote-text">We process pain files for fifteen operating companies across a dozen corridors. We can’t run fifteen separate compliance projects before November. We need to fix this once, centrally, and have every entity benefit — with per-entity reporting the local controllers will accept.</div>
      <div class="quote-author">The problem, in their words</div>
      <div class="quote-role">Head of GBS / SSC Treasury Operations</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section reveal">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-label">Capabilities</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">What You Can Do</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="g2">
      <div class="card card-accent">
        <div class="icon-box ib-teal"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2"/><path d="M7 12h10"/></svg></div>
        <div class="card-title">Group-wide readiness scan</div>
        <div class="card-body">Inventory every entity’s stored addresses in one pass; a per-entity Red/Amber/Green picture before you spend.</div>
        <div style="margin-top:16px;"><span class="badge badge-accent">Classify</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-accent">
        <div class="icon-box ib-blue"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m13 11 6-6"/><path d="M11 13 5 19l-2-2 6-6"/><path d="M19 5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4 0l-2 2 4 4 2-2a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 0-4Z"/></svg></div>
        <div class="card-title">Centralised master-data scrub</div>
        <div class="card-body">Remediate every entity’s backlog from one place, up to 10,000 addresses per call.</div>
        <div style="margin-top:16px;"><span class="badge badge-accent">Correct · batch</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-accent">
        <div class="icon-box ib-cyan"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/><path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4"/></svg></div>
        <div class="card-title">Validate every entity’s pain files</div>
        <div class="card-body">One engine, one rulebook, one audit trail across all operating companies.</div>
        <div style="margin-top:16px;"><span class="badge badge-accent">Process</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-accent">
        <div class="icon-box ib-navy"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="m7 14 4-4 3 3 5-5"/></svg></div>
