  <div class="section reveal" id="implementation">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-label">Implementation Plan</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">From Sandbox to Live</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="g3" style="margin-bottom:var(--space-xl);">
      <div class="decision-box"><div class="decision-label">Span</div><div class="decision-body">Pilot 2–4 wks → each later entity in days</div></div>
      <div class="decision-box"><div class="decision-label">Shape</div><div class="decision-body">Wave-based — one tuned engine inherited by every entity</div></div>
      <div class="decision-box"><div class="decision-label">Tier entry</div><div class="decision-body">Enterprise (multi-entity)</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><div class="step-n">1</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Get started</div><div class="step-body">Sandbox live, first resolved address in ~2 days</div></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-n">2</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Build</div><div class="step-body">Register channels, test; ioNova tunes ~10,000 representative addresses in parallel</div></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-n">3</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Validate</div><div class="step-body">Production validation — channels + integrations exercised together</div></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-n">4</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Go live</div><div class="step-body">Swap test keys for live keys — no code change</div></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="content-block" style="margin-top:var(--space-lg);"><p>Start with one pilot entity on the standard single-track plan. Because the engine is then tuned to the group’s data and the integration pattern is proven, each subsequent entity is a wave — a new Channel Profile that inherits the tuned engine and goes live in days. The full multi-entity rollout typically lands in 2–4 weeks, with both tracks running in parallel throughout.</p></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section reveal">
    <div class="section-header">
