      <h2 class="section-title">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-q">Can one deployment cover many group entities?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9" /></svg></summary>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner"><p>Yes — a single ioNova ARS engine serves every entity, each added as a Channel Profile rather than new infrastructure.</p></div></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-q">Do we have to run a separate compliance project per entity?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9" /></svg></summary>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner"><p>No. You centralise the fix once; each entity inherits the tuned engine and goes live in days.</p></div></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-q">How long does a group rollout take?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9" /></svg></summary>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner"><p>A pilot entity in 2–4 weeks, then each later entity goes live in days.</p></div></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-q">Is each entity’s data isolated?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9" /></svg></summary>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner"><p>Yes — per-tenant isolation, with deployment available in your own VPC, on-premise or air-gapped.</p></div></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-q">Can local controllers see their own entity’s status?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9" /></svg></summary>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner"><p>Yes — per-entity scorecards and audit trails support local sign-off and group audit.</p></div></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-q">Is there one audit trail across the group?<svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9" /></svg></summary>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner"><p>Yes — one engine, one rulebook and one deterministic, rule_source-cited audit trail across every entity.</p></div></div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>

